utActionManager.Status.ModifierKeycodeDescription","source":"The primary and secondary modifiers must have different values from each other and the binding's keycode.","values":{"de-de":"Der primäre und der sekundäre Modifikator müssen unterschiedliche Werte haben und dürfen nicht dem Keycode der Belegung entsprechen.","en-us":"The primary and secondary modifiers must have different values from each other and the binding's keycode.","es-es":"Los modificadores primario y secundario deben tener valores diferentes entre sí y del código de tecla de la vinculación.","fr-fr":"Les modificateurs primaire et secondaire doivent afficher des valeurs différentes l'un de l'autre et du KeyCode de la liaison.","hi-in":"प्राइमरी और सेकंडरी मॉडिफ़ायर की वैल्यू एक-दूसरे से और बाइंडिंग के की-कोड से अलग होनी चाहिए.","id-id":"Pengubah utama dan sekunder harus memiliki nilai yang berbeda satu sama lain dan dari keycode pengikatan.","it-it":"I modificatori primario e secondario devono avere valori diversi tra loro e dal codice chiave dell'associazione.","ja-jp":"プライマリおよびセカンダリのモディファイアは、互いに異なる値を持ち、バインディングのキーコードと異なる値を持つ必要があります。","ko-kr":"기본 수정자와 보조 수정자는 값과 바인딩의 키코드가 서로 달라야 합니다.","nl-nl":"De primaire en secundaire modifiers moeten verschillende waarden hebben ten opzichte van elkaar en de toetscode van de binding.","pl-pl":"Modyfikatory podstawowy i dodatkowy muszą mieć wartości różne od siebie i od klawisza powiązania.","pt-br":"Os modificadores primário e secundário devem ter valores diferentes entre si e do código de tecla da vinculação.","th-th":"ตัวแก้ไขหลักและรองต้องมีค่าแตกต่างกันและต่างจากรหัสคีย์ของการเชื่อมโยง","tr-tr":"Birincil ve ikincil değiştiriciler birbirinden ve bağlamanın tuş kodundan farklı değerlere sahip olmalıdır.","vi-vn":"Các phím bổ trợ chính và phụ phải có giá trị khác nhau và không được trùng với mã phím của tổ hợp phím.","zh-cjv":"主要修改键和次要修改键必须具有彼此不同的值，并且与绑定的按键代码不同。","zh-cn":"主要修改键和次要修改键必须具有彼此不同的值，并且与绑定的按键代码不同。","zh-tw":"主要和次要修改器的數值必須不同，也必須與綁定的 Keycode 不同。"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Status.MissingCompositeKeycodeTitle","source":"Missing Keycode","values":{"de-de":"Keycode fehlt","en-us":"Missing Keycode","es-es":"Falta el código","fr-fr":"Keycode manquant","hi-in":"की-कोड मौजूद नहीं है","id-id":"Tidak ada Keycode","it-it":"Codice chiave mancante","ja-jp":"キーコードが見つかりません","ko-kr":"키코드 누락","nl-nl":"Ontbrekende toetscode","pl-pl":"Brak klawisza","pt-br":"Código de tecla não encontrado","th-th":"ไม่พบรหัสคีย์","tr-tr":"Eksik Tuş Kodu","vi-vn":"Thiếu mã phím","zh-cjv":"缺少按键代码","zh-cn":"缺少按键代码","zh-tw":"缺少 Keycode"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Status.MissingKeycodeTitle","source":"Missing Keycode","values":{"de-de":"Keycode fehlt","en-us":"Missing Keycode","es-es":"Falta el código","fr-fr":"Keycode manquant","hi-in":"की-कोड मौजूद नहीं है","id-id":"Tidak ada Keycode","it-it":"Codice chiave mancante","ja-jp":"キーコードが見つかりません","ko-kr":"키코드 누락","nl-nl":"Ontbrekende toetscode","pl-pl":"Brak klawisza","pt-br":"Código de tecla não encontrado","th-th":"ไม่พบรหัสคีย์","tr-tr":"Eksik Tuş Kodu","vi-vn":"Thiếu mã phím","zh-cjv":"缺少按键代码","zh-cn":"缺少按键代码","zh-tw":"缺少 Keycode"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Status.MissingKeycodeDescription","source":"This action is missing a keycode binding for this schema.","values":{"de-de":"Bei dieser Aktion fehlt eine Keycode-Bindung für dieses Schema.","en-us":"This action is missing a keycode binding for this schema.","es-es":"A esta acción le falta una vinculación de código clave para este esquema.","fr-fr":"Il manque une liaison keycode à cette action pour ce schéma.","hi-in":"इस ऐक्शन में इस स्कीमा के लिए की-कोड बाइंडिंग मौजूद नहीं है.","id-id":"Tindakan ini tidak memiliki pengikatan keycode untuk skema ini.","it-it":"A questa azione manca un codice chiave vincolato a questo schema.","ja-jp":"この動作には、このスキーマのキーコードバインディングがありません。","ko-kr":"이 스키마에는 이 동작에 대한 키코드가 바인딩되어 있지 않습니다.","nl-nl":"Voor deze actie ontbreekt een toetscodebinding voor dit schema.","pl-pl":"W tym działaniu brakuje powiązania klawisza dla tego schematu.","pt-br":"Esta ação não tem um código de tecla vinculado para este esquema.","th-th":"การดำเนินการนี้ไม่มีการผูกรหัสคีย์สำหรับ Schema นี้","tr-tr":"Bu eylemde şemayı bağlayacak bir tuş kodu eksik.","vi-vn":"Hành động này chưa được gán mã phím trong sơ đồ phím này.","zh-cjv":"此操作缺少此架构的按键代码绑定。","zh-cn":"此操作缺少此架构的按键代码绑定。","zh-tw":"此動作缺少此架構的 Keycode 綁定。"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Status.MissingCompositeKeycodeDescription","source":"This composite binding is missing a directional keycode.","values":{"de-de":"Dieser zusammengesetzten Bindung fehlt ein Richtungs-Keycode.","en-us":"This composite binding is missing a directional keycode.","es-es":"A esta vinculación compuesta le falta un código de tecla direccional.","fr-fr":"Il manque un KeyCode directionnel à cette liaison composite.","hi-in":"इस कंपोज़िट बाइंडिंग में डायरेक्शनल की-कोड मौजूद नहीं है.","id-id":"Pengikatan komposit ini tidak memiliki keycode arah.","it-it":"A questa associazione composita manca un codice chiave direzionale.","ja-jp":"このcomposite bindingには方向キーのキーコードがありません。","ko-kr":"이 복합 바인딩에는 방향 키코드가 없습니다.","nl-nl":"Deze samengestelde binding heeft geen directionele toetscode.","pl-pl":"W tym powiązaniu złożonym brakuje klawisza kierunkowego.","pt-br":"Esta vinculação composta está sem um código de tecla direcional.","th-th":"การผูกคอมโพสิทนี้ไม่มีรหัสคีย์ทิศทาง","tr-tr":"Bu bileşik bağda yön belirten tuş kodu eksik.","vi-vn":"Tổ hợp phím này chưa được gán mã phím điều hướng.","zh-cjv":"此复合绑定缺少方向按键代码。","zh-cn":"此复合绑定缺少方向按键代码。","zh-tw":"此複合綁定缺少方向 Keycode。"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Menu.Cancel","source":"Cancel","values":{"de-de":"Abbrechen","en-us":"Cancel","es-es":"Cancelar","fr-fr":"Annuler","hi-in":"कैंसिल करें","id-id":"Batalkan","it-it":"Annulla","ja-jp":"キャンセル","ko-kr":"취소","nl-nl":"Annuleren","pl-pl":"Anuluj","pt-br":"Cancelar","th-th":"ยกเลิก","tr-tr":"İptal et","vi-vn":"Hủy bỏ","zh-cjv":"取消","zh-cn":"取消","zh-tw":"取消"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionMa