UI button.","es-es":"El modificador primario debe ser diferente del botón de la interfaz de usuario asignado a la vinculación.","fr-fr":"Le modificateur primaire doit être différent du bouton d'interface utilisateur attribué à la liaison.","hi-in":"प्राइमरी मॉडिफ़ायर, बाइंडिंग के असाइन किए गए UI बटन से अलग होना चाहिए.","id-id":"Pengubah utama harus berbeda dengan tombol UI yang ditetapkan ke binding.","it-it":"Il modificatore primario deve essere diverso dal pulsante dell'interfaccia utente vincolato all'associazione.","ja-jp":"プライマリモディファイアは、バインディングに割り当てられたUIボタンとは異なる必要があります。","ko-kr":"기본 수정자는 바인딩에 할당된 UI 버튼과 달라야 합니다.","nl-nl":"De primaire modifier moet verschillen van de aan de binding toegewezen UI-knop.","pl-pl":"Podstawowy modyfikator musi być inny niż przycisk interfejsu użytkownika przypisany do powiązania.","pt-br":"O modificador primário deve ser diferente do botão de IU atribuído à vinculação.","th-th":"ปุ่มตัวปรับแต่งหลักต้องแตกต่างจากปุ่ม UI ที่กำหนดให้การเชื่อมโยง","tr-tr":"Birincil değiştirici, bağlamanın atanmış kullanıcı arayüzü düğmesinden farklı olmalıdır.","vi-vn":"Nút bổ trợ chính phải khác với nút UI đã gán cho phím tắt.","zh-cjv":"主要修改键必须与绑定的指定 UI 按钮不同。","zh-cn":"主要修改键必须与绑定的指定 UI 按钮不同。","zh-tw":"主要修改器必須與綁定的指派 UI 按鈕不同。"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Studio.ModifierButtonDescription","source":"The primary modifier must be different from the binding's assigned UI button.","values":{"de-de":"Der primäre Modifikator muss sich von der zugewiesenen UI-Schaltfläche unterscheiden.","en-us":"The primary modifier must be different from the binding's assigned UI button.","es-es":"El modificador primario debe ser diferente del botón de la interfaz de usuario asignado a la vinculación.","fr-fr":"Le modificateur primaire doit être différent du bouton d'interface utilisateur attribué à la liaison.","hi-in":"प्राइमरी मॉडिफ़ायर, बाइंडिंग के असाइन किए गए UI बटन से अलग होना चाहिए.","id-id":"Pengubah utama harus berbeda dengan tombol UI yang ditetapkan ke binding.","it-it":"Il modificatore primario deve essere diverso dal pulsante dell'interfaccia utente vincolato all'associazione.","ja-jp":"プライマリモディファイアは、バインディングに割り当てられたUIボタンとは異なる必要があります。","ko-kr":"기본 수정자는 바인딩에 할당된 UI 버튼과 달라야 합니다.","nl-nl":"De primaire modifier moet verschillen van de aan de binding toegewezen UI-knop.","pl-pl":"Podstawowy modyfikator musi być inny niż przycisk interfejsu użytkownika przypisany do powiązania.","pt-br":"O modificador primário deve ser diferente do botão de IU atribuído à vinculação.","th-th":"ปุ่มตัวปรับแต่งหลักต้องแตกต่างจากปุ่ม UI ที่กำหนดให้การเชื่อมโยง","tr-tr":"Birincil değiştirici, bağlamanın atanmış kullanıcı arayüzü düğmesinden farklı olmalıdır.","vi-vn":"Nút bổ trợ chính phải khác với nút UI đã gán cho phím tắt.","zh-cjv":"主要修改键必须与绑定的指定 UI 按钮不同。","zh-cn":"主要修改键必须与绑定的指定 UI 按钮不同。","zh-tw":"主要修改器必須與綁定的指派 UI 按鈕不同。"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Menu.Enabled","source":"Enabled","values":{"de-de":"Aktiviert","en-us":"Enabled","es-es":"Activado","fr-fr":"Activé","hi-in":"चालू है","id-id":"Diaktifkan","it-it":"Abilitato","ja-jp":"有効化済み","ko-kr":"활성화됨","nl-nl":"Ingeschakeld","pl-pl":"Włączone","pt-br":"Ativado","th-th":"เปิดใช้งานอยู่","tr-tr":"Etkinleştirildi","vi-vn":"Đã bật","zh-cjv":"已启用","zh-cn":"已启用","zh-tw":"已啟用"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Menu.Sink","source":"Sink","values":{"de-de":"Senke","en-us":"Sink","es-es":"Sumidero","fr-fr":"Flux","hi-in":"सिंक","id-id":"Pengeluaran","it-it":"Fonte","ja-jp":"入力を消費","ko-kr":"싱크","nl-nl":"Sink","pl-pl":"Sink","pt-br":"Dreno","th-th":"Sink","tr-tr":"Harcama noktası","vi-vn":"Nguồn tiêu thụ","zh-cjv":"消耗","zh-cn":"消耗","zh-tw":"下滑"}},{"key":"Studio.InputActionManager.Menu.DisplayName","source":"Display Name","values":{"de-de":"Anzeigename","en-us":"Display Name","es-es":"Nombre de visualización","fr-fr":"Nom d'affichage","hi-in":"डिसप्ले नाम","id-id":"Nama Tampilan","it-it":"Nome visualizzato","ja-jp":"表示名","ko-kr":"표시 이름","nl-nl":"Schermnaam","pl-pl":"Nazwa wyświetlana","pt-br":"